      "Seat the TL071CP with pin 1 at F13. Leave pins 1, 5, and 8 isolated.",
      "Use current-limited ±9 V supplies with a shared return. Feed a zero-offset sine from a common-ground generator.",
      "RIN and C1 form the input low-pass. RF and RG set the ideal passband gain to 2."
    ],
